units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
timestep 0.001
lattice fcc 3.52
region unitcell block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box 1 unitcell
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 10 10 10
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity all create 600 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp press pe ke etotal enthalpy vol density
thermo_modify norm no flush yes
fix npt_heating all npt temp 300 2500 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1
run 220000
